* Niacin \> 1g/day or statins in combination with niacin (e.g. Vytorin, Simcor);
* Colchicine;
* Danazol;
* Calcium Channel Blockers: Diltiazem, Varapamil;
* Dronedarone;
* Amiodarone;
* Digoxin;
* Ranolazine;
* Nefazodone;
* Warfarin/Coumadin;
* Lomitapide;
* Grapefruit juice \> 1.2 liters/day (40.5 ounces/day).

