Exclusion Criteria:

* Patients with previous kidney transplants (resumption of dialysis treatment after the transplant period).

Inclusion Criteria:

* Adult individuals (18-70 years old);
* Neck Pain (Chronic Neck Pain or Whiplash);
* Normal vision or corrected vision.

Exclusion Criteria:

